E. Proof-shaped takeaway
  Feasible Q27 blockers appear at four core deletions, so the universal
  eight-core Q27 set-cover lemma is false as stated.  The useful theorem
  should instead classify every feasible packet by its opening channel:
  plain-shell witness, Bprime/owner opening, positive measure, or descent.
